WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:05.733
Wow, we're here.

2
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.133
Couriway Town.

3
00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:10.200
Whoa, awesome.

4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.533
Look at the waterfalls, Clemont.

5
00:00:16.966 --> 00:00:19.566
Couriway Town is known as the town of waterfalls.

6
00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:22.566
And it's the site of the next Pokémon Showcase.

7
00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:25.833
And it's where you're gonna make your debut.

8
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.266
I'm so psyched. Are you?

9
00:00:31.633 --> 00:00:34.866
It's also where I'm gonna win my third Princess Key.

10
00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.300
Our heroes are now in Couriway Town,

11
00:01:17.366 --> 00:01:22.300
where Serena will find out if she moves on to the Pokémon Showcase Master Class.

12
00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.833
So cool.

13
00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:26.066
Yeah, check it out.

14
00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:30.033
This time, the stage incorporates both terrain and waterfalls.

15
00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.333
It's our first performance outside.

16
00:01:35.733 --> 00:01:37.600
Huh? Mm.

17
00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:40.966
I was really nervous my first time also.

18
00:01:41.366 --> 00:01:42.833
And I still get nervous.

19
00:01:43.133 --> 00:01:45.900
But I'm also really excited. Aren't you?

20
00:01:48.633 --> 00:01:51.866
Lots and lots of people are going to watch us perform.

21
00:01:51.933 --> 00:01:53.133
Isn't that wonderful?

22
00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:01.000
All right. You're going to dance during the Freestyle Performance, okay?

23
00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:05.800
Huh?

24
00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:11.466
There's that girl.

25
00:02:24.966 --> 00:02:27.000
Hmm.

26
00:02:30.366 --> 00:02:32.000
So, this is the stage.

27
00:02:32.066 --> 00:02:35.666
I'll just show off my giga-gorgeousness and win this time for sure.

28
00:02:36.133 --> 00:02:38.700
But if you want to perform in the Freestyle Performance,

29
00:02:38.766 --> 00:02:41.166
you first have to get through the Theme Performance.

30
00:02:41.233 --> 00:02:42.266
That's the rule.

31
00:02:42.333 --> 00:02:45.500
You leave that to me.

32
00:03:09.633 --> 00:03:10.466
Eevee?

33
00:03:16.733 --> 00:03:19.300
We'll all stay with you until you can relax, okay?

34
00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:21.666
Right here by your side.

35
00:03:22.133 --> 00:03:23.000
Don't worry.

36
00:03:38.233 --> 00:03:41.400
My only real challenge will be the Theme Performance.

37
00:03:41.466 --> 00:03:44.800
- As long as I get through that--
- You will, because we're gonna find out

38
00:03:44.866 --> 00:03:47.900
- what the theme is ahead of time.
- You're right.

39
00:03:47.966 --> 00:03:49.933
And that is called wisdom.

40
00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.133
Pure genius.

41
00:03:52.366 --> 00:03:54.933
- Which one is it?
- It's got to be one of these.

42
00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.166
Oy vey, this isn't it either.

43
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:01.133
- Come on.
- Come on.

44
00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:04.200
We've run far enough.

45
00:04:04.766 --> 00:04:06.133
We should be fine now.

46
00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.066
That was some freak-out.

47
00:04:08.533 --> 00:04:10.933
And who do you think created this mess?

48
00:04:11.466 --> 00:04:13.133
Hey, what do you got there?

49
00:04:13.633 --> 00:04:16.399
Who knows? I just grabbed whatever was nearby.

50
00:04:16.466 --> 00:04:17.866
What a strange drawing.

51
00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.400
Maybe this is some kind of hint.

52
00:04:22.466 --> 00:04:24.466
Yeah, but what hint? Hmm.

53
00:04:24.933 --> 00:04:28.466
Maybe it's an Ekans with a Mamoswine jammed into its mouth.

54
00:04:28.933 --> 00:04:31.166
To my eye, it looks like a UFO.

55
00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.933
So, it's a performance from another planet?

56
00:04:35.666 --> 00:04:38.200
Wait, maybe this is some kind of Pokémon hat.

57
00:04:38.666 --> 00:04:42.566
You may be right. I'll bet they're gonna test your fashion sense.

58
00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:44.133
I'm sure of it.

59
00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.366
I'll make the perfect Pokémon hat.

60
00:04:48.633 --> 00:04:50.033
I got here first.

61
00:04:53.566 --> 00:04:54.900
Look at all the people.

62
00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:58.166
Bonnie, make sure you stay close by.

63
00:04:58.233 --> 00:05:00.533
- You don't wanna get lost.
- Okay.

64
00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:01.966
Serena.

65
00:05:02.433 --> 00:05:03.566
Hey. Hi.

66
00:05:04.033 --> 00:05:05.833
- Nini. Long time no see.
- Hey.

67
00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.733
Hi, Smoochum. Farfetch'd.

68
00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.300
How are you?

69
00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:12.400
- Smoochum!
- Pancham!

70
00:05:15.933 --> 00:05:17.666
Wow, you've got a Gothita.

71
00:05:17.733 --> 00:05:18.900
It's my new friend.

72
00:05:20.233 --> 00:05:21.833
So cute.

73
00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.866
Gothita, the Fixation Pokémon.

74
00:05:24.966 --> 00:05:28.966
Gothita's psychic powers are made stronger by its ribbon-like feelers.

75
00:05:29.033 --> 00:05:33.866
When Gothita becomes fixated on something, it's looking at something only it can see.

76
00:05:33.966 --> 00:05:35.900
You're entering the Showcase, right?

77
00:05:36.366 --> 00:05:39.133
Of course. One more Princess Key to go.

78
00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.600
And this is where I'll get it.

79
00:05:40.666 --> 00:05:42.366
One more for me, too.

80
00:05:42.433 --> 00:05:43.700
I'm not gonna lose.

81
00:05:43.766 --> 00:05:44.933
Neither am I.

82
00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:48.600
I haven't seen Eevee before.

83
00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:52.166
That's right. Eevee's an amazing dancer.

84
00:05:52.533 --> 00:05:54.100
Oh! Huh?

85
00:05:54.166 --> 00:05:56.500
- Is something wrong?
- Eevee's shy.

86
00:05:56.566 --> 00:05:58.200
She has to get to know you.

87
00:05:58.266 --> 00:05:59.933
And that might take a while.

88
00:06:17.133 --> 00:06:20.300
Bonjour, Pokémon lovers, and welcome.

89
00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.600
Get ready for a competition magnifique.

90
00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:26.266
The Couriway Pokémon Showcase will delight,

91
00:06:26.733 --> 00:06:29.033
as we present our Rookie Class Division.

92
00:06:32.633 --> 00:06:35.200
Allo, I'm your dream world guide...

93
00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.300
Monsieur Pierre.

94
00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:43.566
Prepare to witness a competition par excellence.

95
00:06:43.633 --> 00:06:47.066
The winner gets one step closer to becoming the Kalos Queen

96
00:06:47.133 --> 00:06:48.766
with this Princess Key.

97
00:06:49.233 --> 00:06:53.366
Ladies and gentlemen, tonight's exciting Theme Performance is...

98
00:06:53.833 --> 00:06:55.000
on the screen.

99
00:06:56.833 --> 00:06:59.100
Yes. Pokémon hat making.

100
00:06:59.166 --> 00:07:01.166
Jessie's a shoo-in for headwear.

101
00:07:02.866 --> 00:07:05.300
A Poké Puff performance.

102
00:07:07.233 --> 00:07:11.100
To think I stayed up all night and made 23 hats.

103
00:07:11.166 --> 00:07:14.033
I guess you'll have to find 23 heads.

104
00:07:19.733 --> 00:07:21.633
This should be easy for Serena.

105
00:07:21.766 --> 00:07:23.833
Yeah. Her Poké Puffs are great.

106
00:07:23.966 --> 00:07:26.300
I'm sure she'll get to the Freestyle Performance.

107
00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:30.666
In the Poké Puff performance, it is not just about baking,

108
00:07:30.933 --> 00:07:35.666
but elegantly and imaginatively performing while baking.

109
00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.266
The judging is very simple.

110
00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:41.866
If you think a performance is exceptional, please cast your vote

111
00:07:41.933 --> 00:07:44.466
with the Glow Casters you have at your seat.

112
00:07:44.533 --> 00:07:48.600
If a performer gets enough votes, she'll pass the Theme Performance.

113
00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:54.166
Without further delay, please welcome our first performer, Nini.

114
00:07:59.366 --> 00:08:01.866
Begin your Poké Puff creation.

115
00:08:03.966 --> 00:08:06.333
Farfetch'd. Fury Cutter.

116
00:08:37.233 --> 00:08:39.266
It's all done.

117
00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:43.833
Nini has created a beautiful-looking Poké Puff.

118
00:08:46.733 --> 00:08:47.866
Nini was great.

119
00:08:49.533 --> 00:08:50.733
Boring colors.

120
00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.500
Anything twerp-related is bound to be a snooze fest.

121
00:08:53.566 --> 00:08:55.433
Chespin! Chespin!

122
00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.966
Chespin, you've got to calm down.

123
00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:00.566
Allo, dear audience.

124
00:09:01.033 --> 00:09:03.900
If you enjoyed Nini's performance, please,

125
00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.333
grab hold of your Glow Casters and cast your vote immediately.

126
00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:08.666
Yeah.

127
00:09:16.366 --> 00:09:19.733
Performer Nini has passed the Theme Performance.

128
00:09:20.266 --> 00:09:21.300
Go, us.

129
00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:25.633
Now, our next performer.

130
00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:27.800
Let's welcome, Jessilee.

131
00:09:30.666 --> 00:09:31.666
Mwah!

132
00:09:35.133 --> 00:09:39.533
Note Wobbuffet's maximum power and speed, fueling a super-flour sift.

133
00:09:40.166 --> 00:09:42.033
Now we add a touch of milk.

134
00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:46.566
And next, we have Meowth's paw massage

135
00:09:46.733 --> 00:09:49.366
creating a Poké Puff with spongy spring.

136
00:09:49.433 --> 00:09:51.833
But wait, everybody, there's more.

137
00:09:52.066 --> 00:09:55.266
We top it off with this.

138
00:09:58.666 --> 00:09:59.733
Meow!

139
00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.333
That's so cool.

140
00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:03.533
A Poké Puff stamped with Meowth's charm.

141
00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:06.266
Now, Meowth, Fury Swipe.

142
00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:11.466
Ooey-gooey voilà.

143
00:10:12.366 --> 00:10:14.266
Poké Puffs. Pokémon-stamped.

144
00:10:14.733 --> 00:10:17.700
A Poké Puff with her Pokémon's features. Wow.

145
00:10:17.766 --> 00:10:20.066
So melty and yummy.

146
00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.966
I'll ask Serena to make you some Poké Puffs later,

147
00:10:24.033 --> 00:10:27.566
so would you please sit a little longer and try to enjoy the show?

148
00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:30.566
- Chespin?
- Mm. Huh?

149
00:10:30.633 --> 00:10:32.266
You're something else, huh?

150
00:10:32.333 --> 00:10:34.633
Now's the time to cast your votes.

151
00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:39.733
There you go.

152
00:10:39.933 --> 00:10:42.966
Jessilee has passed the Theme Performance.

153
00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:44.433
Was there any doubt?

154
00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:49.433
She can do it. She can do it. Jessilee.

155
00:10:57.533 --> 00:11:03.033
Allo, our final Theme Performance is next, and it's by Serena.

156
00:11:04.366 --> 00:11:05.866
It's finally her turn.

157
00:11:06.066 --> 00:11:09.100
- You can do it, Serena!
- Go, Pancham.

158
00:11:09.166 --> 00:11:10.666
Pika, Pika!

159
00:11:18.933 --> 00:11:20.933
Who's that Pokémon?

160
00:11:25.933 --> 00:11:27.866
It's Gothita.

161
00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:40.100
Pancham!

162
00:12:03.066 --> 00:12:03.900
Pancham!

163
00:12:05.433 --> 00:12:06.333
Finished.

164
00:12:08.433 --> 00:12:10.233
- You go, Serena.
- Oh, wow, so yummy.

165
00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:12.633
Really great, and what amazing rhythm.

166
00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:13.866
Pika, Pika!

167
00:12:13.933 --> 00:12:17.266
- So, now it's time to cast your votes.
- Serena!

168
00:12:25.333 --> 00:12:29.366
Performer Serena has passed the Theme Performance.

169
00:12:31.266 --> 00:12:32.433
Pancham, we did it.

170
00:12:34.466 --> 00:12:35.600
I hoped so.

171
00:12:36.066 --> 00:12:38.833
Now the Theme Performance comes to an end.

172
00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:42.533
The Freestyle Performance will take place this evening.

173
00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:45.133
So, until then, au revoir.

174
00:12:49.666 --> 00:12:51.000
Here's your Poké Puff.

175
00:12:52.433 --> 00:12:53.566
Thanks so much, Serena.

176
00:12:54.433 --> 00:12:55.433
Sure thing.

177
00:12:57.533 --> 00:12:59.166
You're eating way too fast.

178
00:12:59.233 --> 00:13:01.366
Right, Eevee? Huh?

179
00:13:02.033 --> 00:13:03.366
Eevee, what's wrong?

180
00:13:05.066 --> 00:13:07.266
But you need food for energy, Eevee.

181
00:13:08.366 --> 00:13:10.333
Eevee didn't eat this morning either.

182
00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:12.766
I'll just mix an Oran and a Sitrus Berry in

183
00:13:12.833 --> 00:13:15.500
with the Pokémon food so it's easier to eat.

184
00:13:20.033 --> 00:13:22.100
It worked. I'm glad it's eating.

185
00:13:22.166 --> 00:13:23.933
You practiced so much.

186
00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:25.566
Now all you have to do is dance.

187
00:13:41.166 --> 00:13:43.933
I welcome you back on this lovely evening.

188
00:13:44.233 --> 00:13:48.500
We will now begin our exciting Freestyle Performance.

189
00:13:48.966 --> 00:13:51.266
And first up, it's Nini.

190
00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:57.066
Let's start it off with Powder Snow.

191
00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:01.600
Fury Cutter.

192
00:14:10.366 --> 00:14:12.433
All right, Gothita, use Psychic.

193
00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:20.100
Now use Heart Stamp.

194
00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:25.000
Fury Cutter, let's go.

195
00:14:31.966 --> 00:14:33.966
It's such a heartbreak.

196
00:14:38.833 --> 00:14:40.133
Just what I'd expect.

197
00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:44.000
- Serena? Stand by to go on stage.
- Right.

198
00:14:44.066 --> 00:14:46.500
It's time for Leech Seed.

199
00:14:54.566 --> 00:14:55.966
Wobbuffet, use Counter.

200
00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:11.333
Gourgeist, use Shadow Ball.

201
00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:17.733
Use Seed Bomb.

202
00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:26.866
That's all, folks.

203
00:15:27.333 --> 00:15:28.533
Yes. They nailed it.

204
00:15:28.966 --> 00:15:32.200
She can do it. She can do it. Jessilee.

205
00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:41.000
Okay, Eevee, Braixen.

206
00:15:41.433 --> 00:15:42.466
Are you ready?

207
00:15:44.666 --> 00:15:47.933
It's time for our final Freestyle Performance.

208
00:15:48.100 --> 00:15:50.566
Give a warm welcome to Serena.

209
00:15:53.433 --> 00:15:54.566
Finally. She's up.

210
00:15:54.633 --> 00:15:57.200
She just needs one more key. She can do it.

211
00:15:57.266 --> 00:15:58.200
Pika.

212
00:16:05.066 --> 00:16:07.033
Yeah, here we go.

213
00:16:11.766 --> 00:16:12.833
Braixen.

214
00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:36.200
Way to go.

215
00:16:36.266 --> 00:16:37.600
Yay, Eevee.

216
00:16:42.566 --> 00:16:44.633
Use Flamethrower.

217
00:17:21.433 --> 00:17:22.633
Eevee?

218
00:17:32.766 --> 00:17:33.700
Yeah!

219
00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:36.700
Let's wrap it up.

220
00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:46.466
Now, Braixen, use Fire Blast.

221
00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.133
We're all done.

222
00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:04.633
One of the best performances I've ever seen.

223
00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:08.866
It's all right.

224
00:18:09.233 --> 00:18:10.466
Just think, Eevee.

225
00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:13.366
It was your first performance. Did you have fun?

226
00:18:19.433 --> 00:18:22.933
Allo, light your Glow Casters with the corresponding color

227
00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:27.100
of the performer who you thought gave the best performance.

228
00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:28.333
Yeah!

229
00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:29.400
Jessilee!

230
00:18:41.566 --> 00:18:44.266
Now, the winner has been decided.

231
00:18:44.533 --> 00:18:46.600
And the Princess Key goes to...

232
00:18:47.466 --> 00:18:49.533
performer Jessilee.

233
00:18:51.166 --> 00:18:52.333
Why, that's me.

234
00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.366
Wow, we won.

235
00:18:54.433 --> 00:18:55.800
We were the best.

236
00:18:55.866 --> 00:18:57.700
Wobbuffet!

237
00:18:59.966 --> 00:19:01.866
All right.

238
00:19:03.266 --> 00:19:08.433
Jessilee, as winner of this Showcase, I present you with this Princess Key.

239
00:19:10.666 --> 00:19:12.466
I did it. I did it. I did it.

240
00:19:12.533 --> 00:19:14.300
It's mine.

241
00:19:16.166 --> 00:19:21.366
And that concludes our Couriway Town Rookie Class Pokémon Showcase.

242
00:19:25.933 --> 00:19:27.166
You did it, Jessie.

243
00:19:27.233 --> 00:19:31.200
It sure was a long time coming, but that Princess Key is finally ours.

244
00:19:31.666 --> 00:19:34.366
The title of Kalos Queen is as good as mine.

245
00:19:34.433 --> 00:19:38.566
I heard the entire venue sigh after being mesmerized by my beauty.

246
00:19:42.433 --> 00:19:46.433
The path to becoming royalty is as clear as a bright, sunny day.

247
00:19:46.866 --> 00:19:50.700
All the budding performers who want to be part of the Showcase...

248
00:19:50.766 --> 00:19:55.533
and the many admirers who are captivated by my beauty and charm...

249
00:19:55.600 --> 00:20:01.000
they will all bow down in my presence and give me the adulation I truly deserve.

250
00:20:04.966 --> 00:20:07.333
Number one.

251
00:20:08.566 --> 00:20:10.833
Nini, we'll try it again next time, okay?

252
00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:12.733
Of course. I'll work hard.

253
00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:15.066
Eevee, don't be sad.

254
00:20:15.266 --> 00:20:18.333
- You did great for your first Showcase.
- Pika, Pika.

255
00:20:20.466 --> 00:20:21.300
He's right.

256
00:20:21.566 --> 00:20:23.900
And what's important is to never give up.

257
00:20:24.133 --> 00:20:25.566
No point in being upset.

258
00:20:28.266 --> 00:20:30.066
They all wanna help us out, Eevee.

259
00:20:33.033 --> 00:20:36.200
Okay. Let's do our best at the next Showcase.

260
00:20:38.866 --> 00:20:41.900
Serena wasn't able to win her third Princess Key,

261
00:20:41.966 --> 00:20:47.066
but there's always a next time, as our heroes' journey continues.
